{
 "batchId": "b-0192",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "fr",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_48325aa080e3a520adf3",
   "sourceHash": "48325aa080e3a520adf302c5b280f202327f338af8ff3c1b1ba005bd3c2cd9ef",
   "text": "Chez Kairali, soigner est une responsabilité — pas une promotion.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a0b66727f3068e9a739d",
   "sourceHash": "a0b66727f3068e9a739d74f1c51d18f800e00256dafcb5ffc10f925177825bed",
   "text": "118 ans de tradition ayurvédique. Au service d'une mission.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_af3f7e9577237ae775a0",
   "sourceHash": "af3f7e9577237ae775a03b15234ab10911dc6adf8239c8f6b8ccc3141d49ed07",
   "text": "Depuis plus d'un siècle, Kairali offre des soins spécialisés à celles et ceux qui ont :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe36f540f16e8433b9a4",
   "sourceHash": "fe36f540f16e8433b9a417e0a36b7284d44efabca080e250411707a0c66f24db",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]🏠[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]Donné la vie — nos parents, nos aînés et nos proches qui nous ont portés durant nos premières années[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4325d3f8d3cbd9e1ee84",
   "sourceHash": "4325d3f8d3cbd9e1ee84cdb7bd1b2064240370f9783654591448b2008847df1f",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]🏅[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]Représenté notre nation — les athlètes qui ont porté le drapeau de l'Inde sur les plus grandes scènes du monde[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a64c0b53114b939690f0",
   "sourceHash": "a64c0b53114b939690f00e26d8867d2fc3ef1f7a51306310221e3e74f9ece24e",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]🛡️[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]Protégé nos frontières — les soldats et les forces paramilitaires qui ont consacré des années de leur force à notre sécurité[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b3b270e7dcb64b4583b",
   "sourceHash": "9b3b270e7dcb64b4583b7df6ec45ade7a3e0fb4b2788d3776ff7833c65f09a18",
   "text": "118 ans",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c3e6b56808902273c476",
   "sourceHash": "c3e6b56808902273c4765003ae809add0dc2b48fdbfef4e2e9ad77fda7cc359e",
   "text": "d'excellence ayurvédique",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_efa1b561aa3f689ed3bb",
   "sourceHash": "efa1b561aa3f689ed3bb085dc0dd00bc52a21db4b9f0d8539009c0356488e91a",
   "text": "Pourquoi ces initiatives de soins existent",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b7d4a67208bbf5b27504",
   "sourceHash": "b7d4a67208bbf5b275045f606e82513cc2bd2f386611d52ff5e34799dce78515",
   "text": "Pourquoi Kairali offre une attention particulière",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1035042fa884f42d35df",
   "sourceHash": "1035042fa884f42d35df348e478d6440e7d7c613dae9a8ebc939d20446a9de2e",
   "text": "Face aux soins, tout le monde n'est pas égal. Certaines vies ont besoin d'une prise en charge plus douce.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c4488dac0d689d950a1b",
   "sourceHash": "c4488dac0d689d950a1b1d4e987aaf1a42965d9551d0b0ea73285ef69a1c5cbe",
   "text": "Certains corps portent une charge extraordinaire — une charge acquise au fil du service et du sacrifice.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8c7736d1fe6cde7daae",
   "sourceHash": "c8c7736d1fe6cde7daaed29964522b41775e0c23b37c7a323843929af4e05539",
   "text": "Certains esprits et certains muscles ont servi la nation au-delà des limites ordinaires.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_646491bb8066ef43d45f",
   "sourceHash": "646491bb8066ef43d45f2290367a95708fe2763247f8870f30ac90b018f4a63a",
   "text": "Pratiqué de manière éthique, l'Ayurveda doit répondre à ces réalités avec humilité et sens.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a6d86c174176d1e94fab",
   "sourceHash": "a6d86c174176d1e94fab6d70feff3d62c4c0606fbb3d9ba4d84873deaa5da358",
   "text": "Fondé sur l'éthique, non sur le commerce",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b670700380b07c0b6e3",
   "sourceHash": "9b670700380b07c0b6e3cdc95772b81cda82ba888005d24147bd97bae2a41e0c",
   "text": "Ces programmes existent parce qu'ils sont justes — pas parce qu'ils sont rentables.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d87674622fac5d35ed0a",
   "sourceHash": "d87674622fac5d35ed0a93cffa095865868d86cb76f2c2acd12b61de71917201",
   "text": "Toujours sous la conduite de médecins",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e3588fa36be48235dad",
   "sourceHash": "7e3588fa36be48235dad46e7e6bc4dcf660569e6c6842cd9474a6afeaf3e8c10",
   "text": "Chaque plan de soins est établi par des médecins ayurvédiques qualifiés — jamais standardisé ni préemballé.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e9dc9face3d82b8ddd17",
   "sourceHash": "e9dc9face3d82b8ddd17b4f58251aa63237a39158f12acd4def28a33599ff1a3",
   "text": "La dignité comme fondement",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_639ea091be118167a67e",
   "sourceHash": "639ea091be118167a67e77f8709d8a4fff6a97c3c3daba009419cd221dca5fe0",
   "text": "Aîné, athlète ou ancien combattant — chaque patient est accueilli avec le même respect discret.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned term 'guest' rendered as 'patient'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae1aeeaab287916baf78",
   "sourceHash": "ae1aeeaab287916baf78e5a613b0cf6bdfd5f4b6feca76ab447e4ec2baebe293",
   "text": "Un environnement propice à la guérison",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3a12e266850fa1c5e7aa",
   "sourceHash": "3a12e266850fa1c5e7aa3a6d3bee598d62364ede2c0582ad77e3f6ce64a154fb",
   "text": "Quatorze acres de sérénité verdoyante à Palakkad — pensés pour un repos profond et une véritable récupération.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_afbef2826fb6a39ec5d7",
   "sourceHash": "afbef2826fb6a39ec5d70b01afae5c36789a6adcef32c597b30b1fb4e42661d8",
   "text": "Trois parcours. Un seul engagement.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned term 'Journeys' rendered as 'parcours' (path/process)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e7b87f515c3936a8549",
   "sourceHash": "7e7b87f515c3936a8549a74b852eb5bd44d29ab0e51d7119f2f0d465629e47c6",
   "text": "Trois parcours. Un seul engagement envers la guérison.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned term 'Journeys' rendered as 'parcours' (path/process)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d696d084ed5932de9755",
   "sourceHash": "d696d084ed5932de975524c337a337667cff49c6be26a0b762bd7f1fa82d68bc",
   "text": "Chaque initiative est une histoire de respect — façonnée autour d'un parcours de vie différent, mais unie par un même principe : toute personne qui a beaucoup donné aux autres mérite des soins qui honorent ce don.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
